        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b77cb8f4-3d7a-4c71-a2f6-39eefeb313d1",
      "content": "Retirement Matching\n\nNorthstar offers retirement contribution matching after 3 months of service. The company match is up to 4% of eligible earnings, subject to payroll country rules and plan eligibility.\n\nExact compensation formulas and salary bands are not included in this benefits overview.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "9a6d1350-41b8-4720-91d4-9052b314fdac",
      "content": "Working Hours\n\nStandard collaboration hours are 10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m. local time from Monday to Thursday. Teams may define additional overlap windows when customer coverage or release coordination requires it.\n\nEmployees should keep calendars accurate and mark focus time when unavailable. Repeated inability to meet team collaboration expectations should be discussed with the employee's manager.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "a72be1bf-5c00-44f0-bc47-135dfa3e3760",
      "content": "Office Expectations\n\nHybrid teams should define collaboration days at least one month in advance. Employees should attend required team planning, onboarding, incident review, and customer workshop sessions in person when asked by their manager.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "64f32d21-dc10-42cc-b275-395f3ef6f1e6",
      "content": "Health Benefits\n\nNorthstar provides health, dental, and vision benefits to eligible full-time employees. Coverage begins on the first day of the month after the employee's start date. Plan details vary by employee location.\n\nThis overview does not include provider contracts, claim adjudication rules, or legal advice about benefits eligibility.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "06d7e7e5-b2f6-4da6-b5f6-987b10266c52",
      "content": "Wellness Stipend\n\nEligible full-time employees receive a wellness stipend of 750 CAD or 550 USD per calendar year, based on payroll country. The stipend may be used for fitness memberships, mental health apps, ergonomic equipment, or wellness programs.\n\nUnused wellness stipend amounts do not carry over into the next calendar year.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "483a6ce6-f231-4b14-9190-948b5d6cd35b",
      "content": "Vacation Approval Workflow\n\nVacation requests of 1 to 5 business days should be submitted at least 10 business days in advance. Requests longer than 5 business days should be submitted at least 20 business days in advance.\n\nManagers approve vacation based on business coverage, project deadlines, and fairness across the team. Managers should not deny vacation without explaining the business reason.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b6f7d058-c59b-40e2-bf9b-3a560a873391",
      "content": "Related Policies\n\nFor time off, consult the PTO and Leave Policy. For remote work, consult the Remote and Hybrid Work Policy. For acceptable technology use, consult the Acceptable Use Policy.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "4ec63d09-594a-4640-b1f7-5db5f5b9b238",
      "content": "Work Model\n\nNorthstar supports hybrid work and approved remote work. Employees assigned to Toronto, Montreal, or New York offices are expected to attend office collaboration days when scheduled by their department.\n\nRemote employees may work from approved locations in Canada or the United States if their role, tax location, and security requirements support remote work.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "79e28ac2-ea1b-45ff-9a0d-d5ca18b2b19e",
      "content": "Vacation Entitlement\n\nFull-time employees receive 20 paid vacation days per calendar year. Vacation is accrued monthly and may be used after the employee's first 30 days of employment. Part-time employees receive prorated vacation based on scheduled weekly hours.\n\nEmployees may carry over up to 5 unused vacation days into the next calendar year. Carried-over days must be used by March 31 or they expire unless local law requires a different outcome.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "67bd1b4b-6acc-43d0-8a40-a049d27b6329",
      "content": "Benefits Support\n\nEmployees should contact the benefits support queue for enrollment questions, coverage questions, or life event changes. Urgent benefits questions should not be posted in public team channels.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
