        "chunk_id": "79e28ac2-ea1b-45ff-9a0d-d5ca18b2b19e",
        "content_preview": "Vacation Entitlement\n\nFull-time employees receive 20 paid vacation days per calendar year. Vacation is accrued monthly and may be used after the employee's first 30 days of employment. Part-time employees receive prorated vacation based on scheduled weekly hours.\n\nEmployees may carry over up to 5 unused vacation days into the next calendar year. Carried-over days must be used by March 31 or they expire unless local law requires a different outcome.",
